// The lint driver's single gate command table, compiled and audited as text.
// Each nonblank line is either a // comment or one canonical LINT_ROW.
// Row names are check- followed by lowercase ASCII letters, digits or hyphens.
// Commands support quotes, $VAR, NAME=v prefixes and && only.
// "__core_seal__" names the built-in core-seal pipeline (run_exec.c).
// One row per line, string escapes \" and \\ only; first row wins.

